            <div xml:id="m-516c12d8-f423-4b05-b326-4d52d3109f10">
              <lg xml:id="m-7f69a985-f921-4225-ac9e-1ef29e7fb3ab">
                <l xml:id="m-4c2eb281-5949-4951-b460-1a572be70233" facs="#m-f769fe08-133d-412c-aad4-ee58cd9bcd09" label="text-like">1172 Common of Two or More Martyrs. Mass III.</l><l xml:id="m-33db27a5-7d23-4d67-8e8d-22dcc29efec8" facs="#m-f0fb7de5-cd5a-4698-8cb5-069317743379" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 12. a.</l><l xml:id="m-a41efddf-f026-4dfe-b805-97f15d1017c2" facs="#m-84f0b201-ef11-4a66-bbc7-4e0afdb53553" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus di-quem timeátis: timéte eum, qui</l><l xml:id="m-3281b191-bdc5-48e6-bda4-2b3a4ef3f020" facs="#m-e9a34895-c9a5-4f15-a15c-c6b21fd5ac5d" label="lyrics-like">I scipulis suis: Atténdite a fer-postquam occiderit, habet potestá¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e064a76-15b8-450b-b487-ef9055020fa8" facs="#m-9f9e161a-976a-4468-9ad3-0ec08e30ad3a" label="lyrics-like">ménto pharisaeórum, quod est tem mittere in gehénnam. Ita dico</l><l xml:id="m-e77b51f6-2e98-4bdc-954c-913895d85b7d" facs="#m-3beeceec-2f15-420c-b3bd-ee9328b7fa70" label="lyrics-like">hypócrisis. Nihil autem opértum</l><l xml:id="m-506a3506-ddf0-4d37-b29a-9be253472c32" facs="#m-75782736-6741-4f85-aaa0-ea139afb5af5" label="lyrics-like">vobis: hunc timéte. Nonne quinque</l><l xml:id="m-72cffa89-b2b7-4cbc-936d-f9c5312a600e" facs="#m-dd463270-f1ba-42ee-be0f-50fac487f664" label="lyrics-like">pásseres véneunt dipóndio, et unus</l><l xml:id="m-c6a8a292-1215-4acc-9768-6062a85f0aa7" facs="#m-64d78d0d-c4b0-479d-8f4b-d71e568262af" label="lyrics-like">est, quod non revelétur: neque</l><l xml:id="m-3a5bcd63-87d3-49df-8d59-37a18a2c6252" facs="#m-da700beb-01cc-46a7-810c-271b0c3c6a80" label="lyrics-like">ex illis non est in oblivióne coram</l><l xml:id="m-6c1274f3-0d43-457e-bb63-0cf8fd2cba79" facs="#m-71c8302d-1bb8-42eb-abed-31a3d01ed016" label="lyrics-like">abscónditum, quod non sciátur.</l><l xml:id="m-0e5f1a6d-cb25-4c79-aa5c-38e675db5e8c" facs="#m-7bec85f0-7372-4f7b-b855-8776f48e5a59" label="lyrics-like">Deo? Sed et capilli cápitis vestri</l><l xml:id="m-5bfc7b56-3b71-49c9-a049-2820f9cd9204" facs="#m-29de5fee-e145-43d6-b39f-988a20d5a861" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam, quæ in ténebris dixistis,</l><l xml:id="m-d1adde22-0110-4774-8f35-f6f244a5a813" facs="#m-1a74499e-bace-4da2-82dd-c20df7b073ae" label="lyrics-like">in lúmine dicéntur: et quod in lomnes numeráti sunt. Nolite ergo</l><l xml:id="m-cec5182d-5085-4c5b-a703-322783272030" facs="#m-f338c494-77ac-4eab-9e10-c01bd80654b5" label="lyrics-like">timére: multis passéribus pluris</l><l xml:id="m-3d485416-08e3-41ad-9a96-35fb25b98f6f" facs="#m-28659d83-6d20-4626-8c2a-edd59733bfa5" label="lyrics-like">aurem locúti estis in cubículis,</l><l xml:id="m-0d3a3e8d-08fc-4559-b735-db8793ca0441" facs="#m-3104c1c5-0e1a-4378-be4e-b3de5417d89d" label="lyrics-like">praedicábitur in tectis. Dico autem] estis vos. Dico autèm vobis : Omnis</l><l xml:id="m-91552efb-a951-4c39-baf7-e169fb9211e4" facs="#m-55bd48ae-7403-465e-8297-38d5639ca15a" label="lyrics-like">vobis amícis meis: Ne terreámini! quicúmque conféssus fúerit me</l><l xml:id="m-16d3bbed-a02d-42d5-abab-5c0efecb507b" facs="#m-eaa20842-e69d-49e6-8b69-8b87dcb694c2" label="lyrics-like">ab his, qui occídunt corpus, et post! coram hominibus, et Filius hómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-81dce76f-61ad-470e-9354-4dbd8e879f3d" facs="#m-858a84e7-8d7c-4059-8dba-5a5ba4e40894" label="lyrics-like">haec non habent ámplius quid nis confitébitur illum coram Ange¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3602656-577f-4641-9e76-b3dd6bee7e90" facs="#m-9be1531e-4f02-4709-972c-e12de94605a0" label="lyrics-like">fáciant. Osténdam autem vobis! lis Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-91d413ee-76de-4979-b672-20726b094344" facs="#m-62590d0e-3b99-4339-be8b-0eebc36cc3d4" label="ambiguous">orert.&amp;</l><l xml:id="m-0b0b087d-2dd2-4b06-94b2-f3766fe5c165" facs="#m-bd592837-f1f9-4562-b5eb-98a15418568d" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-1f1f7395-90fa-4d5e-a954-9f381865afd0" facs="#m-ccd10696-c576-458d-b101-9104e2a165ec" label="ambiguous">Use</l><l xml:id="m-64754a26-11ea-4324-9bbf-d5d46aaac496" facs="#m-af8a50c4-a390-45e4-8f80-151de1761431" label="lyrics-like">in má¬</l><l xml:id="m-14706d44-5b52-4a9b-a8ad-4430b053417a" facs="#m-abdc9acb-87f8-4b80-a277-9ee895df68c8" label="lyrics-like">rum “á-nimae</l><l xml:id="m-c432365c-a054-45b3-bbc8-0130dacbdfc9" facs="#m-30101dc0-a8cf-4374-b639-e6b95a56d386" label="ambiguous">los</l><l xml:id="m-1d054ba4-3fe6-4982-a6aa-134a52c5b0ad" facs="#m-917b3abe-ed01-4f1c-b947-1aa384aa930a" label="lyrics-like">nu Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-3acd287c-6dc9-4329-ad2b-fdb3d129f1c7" facs="#m-3e590825-e290-4ed9-92ac-8b8977195a07" label="lyrics-like">non tánget i¬</l><l xml:id="m-b4159a41-ebb8-445b-abd3-fa7d502a28f1" facs="#m-127502b9-e564-4711-a1be-d8ae324385e0" label="ambiguous">i sunt, et</l><l xml:id="m-f96dafec-71f3-4460-9b90-ef424df5b2a2" facs="#m-9e385c09-40ee-4313-8cd6-ad2f99a54724" label="lyrics-like">6́¬</l><l xml:id="m-21bca612-1ae1-40bc-a0cb-de95d348c7f4" facs="#m-eb85896f-bf73-43d4-a988-84888b5e6421" label="lyrics-like">tormén¬</l><l xml:id="m-636125e4-f771-45c7-8f6a-b63cc686ecf6" facs="#m-1c91f50f-0a2f-43fd-9b00-7b3730f5100e" label="lyrics-like">tum ma-lí-ti- ae: ví-si sunt</l><l xml:id="m-a9a53a75-b15e-42d1-830d-5e0684c82f6f" facs="#m-411b6543-531e-4942-917f-b79b6ece9000" label="lyrics-like">cu-lis insi-pi-énti-um mó¬ ri</l><l xml:id="m-63aaba7f-0d81-42d1-9e38-f76661e54006" facs="#m-119d8aa7-74b1-43a4-8607-9863b6c364f6" label="ambiguous">illi au¬</l><l xml:id="m-4eb27cb3-c2fb-40d9-a301-8ab0d5565f3e" facs="#m-82de80ae-0b04-4629-9692-f19e1c7bc7bd" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-7b707452-25d0-4c93-bee2-9c1f4eb8b8ae" facs="#m-dfe00171-ba51-4ab8-ab11-7cd5b09e460e" label="ambiguous">tem sunt in</l><l xml:id="m-45c83143-4bb2-4049-92a6-7743566de4d1" facs="#m-215bd106-0743-49cf-b9ee-30b7cc228a47" label="lyrics-like">pá-ce,</l><l xml:id="m-d5d0031a-e44f-46c7-ab49-340d96566a9a" facs="#m-cffe85ee-f62c-42c3-a532-7697ee5bf99e" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-8e2b2c85-f9cb-451f-b53c-b13462354f2e" facs="#m-66dfb83e-b846-4cfb-9e21-56e22884119f" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-d961f1f4-a514-498a-be6a-a00bdfb939ac" facs="#m-6a3388e3-d6a4-4048-bba3-6bff8b174fc2" label="lyrics-like">Blátis, quæsumus, Dómine, pla-] N. a cunctis nos defénde periculis.</l><l xml:id="m-dfcb8fe3-fde9-4ddc-84f6-b3061d155b00" facs="#m-89cf1fb4-7760-4421-acbd-ca7be315ae02" label="lyrics-like">U cáre munéribus: et intercedén¬</l><l xml:id="m-c07e9ed1-4724-46bb-ae63-1b8f79d2aa91" facs="#m-cd6f7b55-101a-45d8-bce1-3b96fbe22124" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-cdc3fe5a-77d2-4c9f-9901-bd14a49c3e5f" facs="#m-5dbd6e45-3654-4eaf-b3d9-9015c9e76a84" label="ambiguous">tibus sanctis Martyribus tuis N. et</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>